---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="description" content="You found it." />
    <title>.secret — Classified | Venkat Sundaraneedi</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  </head>
  <body class="secret-body">
    <main class="doc">
      <div class="doc-header">
        <span class="stamp">Classified</span>
        <span class="doc-class">/// TOP SECRET ///</span>
      </div>

      <div class="doc-body">
        <h1>You weren't supposed to find this.</h1>
        <p>
          But since you did, welcome. You're the kind of person who types{' '}
          <span class="code">cat .secret</span> on a 404 page and then{' '}
          <em>actually</em> tries <span class="code">/secret</span> in the URL bar.
        </p>
        <p>Here's what you've earned:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>The developer thinks <span class="redacted" tabindex="0">pineapple</span> belongs on pizza. This is a hill he will die on.</li>
          <li>Hidden pages: <a class="code" href="/gpg">/gpg</a>, <a class="code" href="/now">/now</a>, <a class="code" href="/writing">/writing</a>, <a class="code" href="/guestbook">/guestbook</a></li>
          <li>Open the browser console. There's ASCII art. Really.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>That's all the secrets. <span class="redacted" tabindex="0">For now.</span></p>
        <p class="doc-stamp">CLASSIFICATION: EYES ONLY</p>
      </div>

      <div class="doc-footer">
        <span>FILE: .secret</span>
        <a href="/">← cd ~ (go home)</a>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  .secret-body {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: var(--space-4);
    min-height: 100vh;
  }
  .doc {
    max-width: 580px;
    width: 100%;
    background: var(--white);
    border: 3px solid var(--line);
    overflow: hidden;
    filter: drop-shadow(7px 7px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 1));
  }
  .doc-header {
    background: var(--red);
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--line);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }
  .stamp {
    border: 3px solid var(--line);
    padding: 3px var(--space-3);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    background: var(--accent);
    transform: rotate(-6deg);
  }
  .doc-class {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
  }
  .doc-body {
    padding: var(--space-6);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .doc-body h1 {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }
  .doc-body p {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }
  .doc-body ul {
    padding-inline-start: var(--space-6);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-4);
  }
  .doc-body li {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }
  .doc-body .code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    background: var(--accent);
    padding: 2px 5px;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .doc-body a.code:hover {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .redacted {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--ink);
    padding: 0 var(--space-2);
    user-select: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition:
      background 0.2s ease,
      color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .redacted:hover {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .doc-stamp {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--ink-3);
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
  }
  .doc-footer {
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
    border-top: 3px solid var(--line);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 700;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }
</style>
